{"ID":"20230711173554-zlwzpci","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20230711173554-zlwzpci","name":"向量模长和单位向量","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230711173554-zlwzpci\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230711174045-11bdeyz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230711173904-4j4ji2b\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:259,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20230711174045-11bdeyz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"U2L4-1——向量模长和单位向量","type":"doc","updated":"20250918115822"},"Children":[{"ID":"20230711174045-11bdeyz","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20230711174045-11bdeyz","updated":"20250918115822"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"向量模长和单位向量"}]},{"ID":"20230711174047-3eluvfj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230711174047-3eluvfj","updated":"20240321171217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"得到了向量 就可以利用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Vector3"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 中提供的 成员属性 得到 模长 和 单位向量"}]},{"ID":"20240321171141-ds8cc15","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20240321171141-ds8cc15","updated":"20240321171436"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240321171141-zyxzkb7","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20240321171141-zyxzkb7","updated":"20240321171155"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240321171141-lnm29kx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240321171141-lnm29kx","updated":"20240321171155"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"模长：相当于可以得到 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"两点之间的距离"}]}]},{"ID":"20240321171142-ldj5uen","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20240321171142-ldj5uen","updated":"20240321171436"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240321171142-1je1brb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240321171142-1je1brb","updated":"20240321171436"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"单位向量：主要是用来进行移动计算的，它不会影响我们想要的移动结果，一般是用来表示方向"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20230711173657-s7ym11q","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20230711173657-s7ym11q","updated":"20250918115822"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本章代码关键字"}]},{"ID":"20230711173707-xf8qz5g","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20230711173707-xf8qz5g","style":"line-height: 22px;","updated":"20250918115822"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"YyM="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"vector3.magnitude\t\t//获取向量的模长的属性，只想要长度，排除方向\nvector3.normalized\t\t//获取模长为一的单位向量的属性，只想要方向，排除长度\nvector3.sqrMagnitude\t//获取向量的模长平方的属性，在比较模长长度时相比直接使用magnitude具有性能优势\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20230711173619-md0l73b","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20230711173619-md0l73b","name":"vector3.magnitude","updated":"20250918114740"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"向量的模长"}]},{"ID":"20230711173634-4ihpu5g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20230711173634-4ihpu5g","updated":"20250918114740"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"向量的长度（只想要长度，排除方向），模长 相当于可以得到 两点之间的距离\n​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Vector3"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 中提供了获取向量模长的成员属性 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"magnitude"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20230711173645-5eazo0q","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20230711173645-5eazo0q","updated":"20230711173651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"YyM="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"print(AB.magnitude);\nVector3 C = new Vector3(5, 6, 7);\nprint(C.magnitude);\n\nprint(Vector3.Distance(A, B));\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20230711173554-qloxixr","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20230711173554-qloxixr","name":"vector3.normalized","updated":"20250918114636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"单位向量"}]},{"ID":"20240321171233-gsbwype","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240321171233-gsbwype","updated":"20240321171233"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"模长为一的单位向量（只想要方向，排除长度）\n单位向量 主要是用来进行移动计算的 它不会影响我们想要的移动结果"}]},{"ID":"20230711174006-y6qnb31","Type":"NodeMathBlock","Properties":{"id":"20230711174006-y6qnb31","updated":"20240321171240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeMathBlockOpenMarker"},{"Type":"NodeMathBlockContent","Data":"单位向量 = \\frac{向量}{向量模长}"},{"Type":"NodeMathBlockCloseMarker"}]},{"ID":"20240321171233-y5ukpv5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240321171233-y5ukpv5","updated":"20240321171249"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Vector3"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​中提供了获取向量单位向量的成员属性"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"normalized"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20230711173838-mppmqd4","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20230711173838-mppmqd4","updated":"20230711174013"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"YyM="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"print(AB.normalized);\nprint(AB / AB.magnitude);\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20230711173904-4j4ji2b","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20230711173904-4j4ji2b","name":"vector3.sqrMagnitude","updated":"20250918115410"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"向量模长的平方"}]},{"ID":"20250918114743-0xbinty","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918114743-0xbinty","updated":"20250918115410"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Vector3.sqrMagnitude"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 可以得到向量长度的平方，因为少了开平方的步骤，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"因此在比较向量长度距离时，相比于直接使用"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code strong","TextMarkTextContent":"magnitude"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性能会更好"}]},{"ID":"20250918114657-54d3lik","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250918114657-54d3lik","updated":"20250918115325"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"YyM="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"var c = new Vector3(5, 6, 7);\nprint($\"square of c: {c.sqrMagnitude}, sqrt: {Mathf.Sqrt(c.sqrMagnitude)}\");\nprint($\"distance of c: {c.magnitude}\");\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250918115327-suutvud","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250918115327-suutvud","updated":"20250918115347"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20250918115347-xu4tvk7.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]}]}